WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.800
A section that could never fill.

2
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:08.600
The page was fetched, then thrown away.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.500
But a company does not invent a standard.

4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.800
So the scanner finds it and the model reads it.

5
00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.800
Have it, or working towards it. Same words.

6
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:25.100
So the report says states, never is certified.

7
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:29.400
Freezing a real page found a duplicate at once.

8
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:33.600
And measuring found the page it read instead.

9
00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:37.600
88 calls become 103. Five of six now fill.

10
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.600
One fewer section that can never fill.
